{"verse_key": "13:25", "surah": 13, "verse": 25, "text_uthmani": "وَٱلَّذِينَ يَنقُضُونَ عَهْدَ ٱللَّهِ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مِيثَـٰقِهِۦ وَيَقْطَعُونَ مَآ أَمَرَ ٱللَّهُ بِهِۦٓ أَن يُوصَلَ وَيُفْسِدُونَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۙ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمُ ٱللَّعْنَةُ وَلَهُمْ سُوٓءُ ٱلدَّارِ", "translation": "But those who break the covenant of Allāh after contracting it and sever that which Allāh has ordered to be joined and spread corruption on earth - for them is the curse, and they will have the worst home.<sup foot_note=196556>1</sup>", "verse_from_ms": 621640, "verse_to_ms": 652620, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 621640, "end_ms": 623080}, {"i": 1, "text": "يَنقُضُونَ", "start_ms": 623080, "end_ms": 624660}, {"i": 2, "text": "عَهْدَ", "start_ms": 624660, "end_ms": 625200}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 625200, "end_ms": 626020}, {"i": 4, "text": "مِنۢ", "start_ms": 626020, "end_ms": 626790}, {"i": 5, "text": "بَعْدِ", "start_ms": 626790, "end_ms": 627420}, {"i": 6, "text": "مِيثَـٰقِهِۦ", "start_ms": 627420, "end_ms": 628780}, {"i": 7, "text": "وَيَقْطَعُونَ", "start_ms": 628780, "end_ms": 630270}, {"i": 8, "text": "مَآ", "start_ms": 630270, "end_ms": 631700}, {"i": 9, "text": "أَمَرَ", "start_ms": 631700, "end_ms": 632310}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 632310, "end_ms": 633150}, {"i": 11, "text": "بِهِۦٓ", "start_ms": 633150, "end_ms": 635289}, {"i": 12, "text": "أَن", "start_ms": 635290, "end_ms": 635470}, {"i": 13, "text": "يُوصَلَ", "start_ms": 635470, "end_ms": 636900}, {"i": 14, "text": "وَيُفْسِدُونَ", "start_ms": 636900, "end_ms": 639870}, {"i": 15, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 639870, "end_ms": 641890}, {"i": 16, "text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "start_ms": 641890, "end_ms": 642180}, {"i": 17, "text": "ۙ", "start_ms": 642180, "end_ms": 642920}, {"i": 18, "text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "start_ms": 642920, "end_ms": 645160}, {"i": 19, "text": "لَهُمُ", "start_ms": 6